BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 716.00 Tm (Payment and recovery failures come next. Alex Auto warns that Uber and Lyft account screenshots can be) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 700.77 Tm (faked, so even with the platforms already running background and MVR checks, that operation still runs its) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 685.55 Tm (own background check and license verification rather than trusting the platform's screening alone) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 670.32 Tm ([UJnOivSethI @ 00:04:00]. King of Rentals is blunter about money in motion: do not take a Zelle payment) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 655.10 Tm (and take the renter's word for it, because 'you will lose 99% of the time' [qwQ8yQbhunw @ 01:09:58].) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 639.87 Tm (Recovery hardware is treated as mandatory rather than optional. Yanni, interviewed on darius benders after) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 624.65 Tm (four years of renting cars to Uber drivers in Michigan, runs two trackers per car and sometimes three, each) Tj ET
