BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 594.20 Tm (Tracks, Trackhawk, or Fleet Bolt with a kill switch, budgets a couple hundred dollars per device and install) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 578.97 Tm (plus a monthly fee, and repossesses once a renter runs 24 to 48 hours late [amfsF8yd5hg @ 00:07:58].) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 563.75 Tm (Across all four operators, verification that rests on a screenshot, a payment-app promise, or a single tracker) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 548.52 Tm (is exactly where cars and cash leak out of the fleet, so the controls get installed and enforced before the first) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 533.30 Tm (week is ever collected.) Tj ET
