BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 502.85 Tm (debt against $750K of cars, as the over-leverage warning every scaling fleet should study, and pairs it with) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 487.62 Tm (the rule to always have an exit plan when buying cars [qwQ8yQbhunw @ 00:58:19]. Alex Auto shows why) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 472.40 Tm (financed cars bleed in this model: a $20K Camry driven 3,000 to 4,000 miles a month is worth under $10K) Tj ET
