BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 441.95 Tm (pitch frames $400 a week as $1,600 a month and about $19,000 a year, after flagging maintenance, gap) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 426.72 Tm (weeks, insurance, and bad renters as real costs, yet the reveal lands on $2,220 at $74 a day) Tj ET
