BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 609.42 Tm (support either: most of these vendors are small dev teams, a developer last cost Mike almost $70 an hour, a) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 594.20 Tm (single page can take three to four hours, and new features only ship once enough users ask for the same) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 578.97 Tm (thing, which is why Mike says to lock in launch pricing before it climbs [1Va2FwAMf2A @ 00:24:35]. Fleet) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 563.75 Tm (Finesse also ships without a rental agreement, so you paste in your own text and drag in fields like customer) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 548.52 Tm (name, make, VIN, and start date before the first contract goes out.) Tj ET
